                                <div class="gs-setting-card" style="line-height: 1.75; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #d1d5db;">
                                    <ul style="padding-left: 18px; margin: 0;">
                                        <li><strong>Decision Engine</strong>: Glacier.Clavier System-1 intent routing &amp; step supervision</li>
